=== poi-P1 (rejection): FORCE INDEX serving neither a bound nor the ORDER BY (no WHERE) ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: FORCE INDEX 'idx_o_custkey' cannot be used: the query has no WHERE condition that can serve as an index bound, and the ORDER BY is not a prefix of the index.

=== poi-P2 (rejection): FORCE INDEX serving neither a bound nor the ORDER BY (residual WHERE) ===
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: FORCE INDEX 'idx_o_custkey' cannot be used: no WHERE condition matches its leading column, and the ORDER BY is not a prefix of the index.
